            },
          ],
          "required": false,
        },
        {
          "description": "Claude Code tools for a 'claude-code' run. Allowed names: 'WebSearch', 'WebFetch', 'Read', 'Grep', 'Glob'; [] means no tools. Omit for the default: Read, Grep and Glob inside the session's project directory for a task queued from a Claude Code session; else WebSearch and WebFetch (TIDEGAP_CLAUDE_TOOLS overrides that one). A web tool makes a task from a session run fresh, without the session's context. Any other name (Bash, Write, Edit, ...) is rejected, and so is a set that combines a file tool (Read, Grep, Glob) with a web tool. Web content is untrusted, so tools that run commands or write files are never offered.",
          "itemKind": "string",
          "kind": "array",
          "name": "tools",
