          "kind": "string",
          "name": "origin_session_id",
          "required": false,
        },
        {
          "description": "If true, the task does not start before the Claude subscription limit resets (the latest reset of an exhausted 5-hour or weekly window, else the reset of the fuller window; see tidegap_usage); it then runs at the cleanest hour after that. The deadline rises to at least two hours after the reset. Fails, queuing nothing, when no limit state is known.",
          "kind": "boolean",
