      "description": "Change the deadline of one queued or scheduled task and re-pick its cleanest window inside it. Use when: the user moves the due time, earlier or later ("by 6pm instead"). Do not use to run now (use expedite_task) or to stop it (use cancel_task). Behavior: rewrites only this task in the local queue, clears its quota rule and re-reads the grid forecast; no login or key. A repeat call only re-picks the hour. Returns: task_id, status, scheduled_for, new_deadline. Throws on running, finished or unknown tasks and a past deadline.",
